From: Russell Ballestrini <russell@unturf.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 25/29] b43: AC-PHY: the per-frame CPU cost of the core rev 42 path

No per-frame diagnostics, one TX kick per interrupt, interrupt re-poll,
RX cache sync of the used length, RX list handoff (acphy_fastpath).
